    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play.</h2>Each pixel is numbered, and each paint is numbered.  Match all of the paints to their corresponding pixel to reveal the picture!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=500 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends!</h2>Paint together with up to 23 friends!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/332ed6fcb57814ee4348b616aa24efb7.avif?t=1725004184\" width=332 height=358 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over a 100 pictures!</h2>Sit down with a coffee, and start doodling, there's plenty of content to relax and pick away at!  And lots of FREE updates for more pictures on the way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=538 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>With the FREE updates the count is currently 663 images!</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2>Every pixel you paint rewards XP!  As you gain XP you will level up!  Every level up will give you a chest where you can pick one of 3 goodies inside!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express yourself</h2>Decorate your paintbrush with icons and sparkles!  Every duplicate item you get of that type displays as your brush / sparkle level!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1725004184\" width=240 height=240 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play.</h2>Each pixel is numbered, and each paint is numbered.  Match all of the paints to their corresponding pixel to reveal the picture!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=500 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/3b8927f2b1d1a2f6d0035e0e0877eaa0.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends!</h2>Paint together with up to 23 friends!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/332ed6fcb57814ee4348b616aa24efb7.avif?t=1725004184\" width=332 height=358 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over a 100 pictures!</h2>Sit down with a coffee, and start doodling, there's plenty of content to relax and pick away at!  And lots of FREE updates for more pictures on the way!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=538 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/987c8dbfa15a6c7846574b10d6bc5fb5.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>With the FREE updates the count is currently 663 images!</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2>Every pixel you paint rewards XP!  As you gain XP you will level up!  Every level up will give you a chest where you can pick one of 3 goodies inside!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.poster.avif?t=1725004184\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.webm?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/dda2a3f5aeed63a9a682291c65a34a5e.mp4?t=1725004184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express yourself</h2>Decorate your paintbrush with icons and sparkles!  Every duplicate item you get of that type displays as your brush / sparkle level!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953230/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1725004184\" width=240 height=240 /></span>",
